  {"id": 4, "title": "Incomplete information", "briefing": ["Fog of war: you see full detail one lane out from your systems, and grey shapes three lanes out.", "A grey system shows what you last saw there, not what is there now. Rival fleets show only near your space.", "Be prepared for dead ends and surprise enemy appearances.", "In the menu, sight 1 / scout 2 makes a closer, nervier game; sight 1-2 / scout 4 is more open but still hidden."], "hint": "Grey is what you last saw, not what's there. The enemy is out there somewhere!",
