  {"id": 5, "title": "Three's a crowd", "briefing": ["Two rivals now, and no teams: they fight each other as well as you.", "You start in the middle, between them. Don't get stuck there, or you'll be fighting on two fronts at once.", "Push hard one way and keep a guard facing the other. If they meet each other, let them fight.", "When several sides land on one system in the same turn, the attackers fight each other first and the survivor meets the garrison."], "hint": "You're in the middle. Push one way, guard the other, don't fight both at once.",
