  {"id": 7, "title": "Thinker", "briefing": ["The bots so far have been simple. This one plans: it prices each fight before it sends.", "It won't throw ships at a garrison it can't take, and it notices a system you've left thin.", "Everything you've learned applies. Expand fast, guard home, and attack with a margin."], "hint": "Thinker prices its fights. Don't leave a system thin next to it.",
